{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LangChain与LangGraph的区别与关系\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LangChain与LangGraph的区别与关系\" dir=\"auto\">LangChain与LangGraph的区别与关系</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangChain和LangGraph都是构建LLM应用的重要框架，请详细说明它们之间的区别、关系，以及在什么场景下应该选择哪个？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心定位差异</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangChain和LangGraph是同一技术栈中解决不同层次问题的框架，二者是<strong>互补关系</strong>而非竞争关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>LangChain</th>\n<th>LangGraph</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>定位</strong></td>\n<td>LLM应用开发框架（组件库+编排层）</td>\n<td>工作流编排引擎（基于状态图）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>设计理念</strong></td>\n<td>模块化、链式组合</td>\n<td>状态驱动、图拓扑编排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>执行模式</strong></td>\n<td>线性Chain为主</td>\n<td>任意有向图（含循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>控制流</strong></td>\n<td>顺序执行</td>\n<td>条件分支、循环、并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>状态管理</strong></td>\n<td>手动/半自动</td>\n<td>全局State自动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>适用场景</strong></td>\n<td>RAG、简单Agent、快速原型</td>\n<td>复杂工作流、多步骤审批、多Agent协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>关系说明：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangGraph实际上是LangChain生态的一部分，它构建在LangChain的核心组件之上：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">LangGraph 架构层次\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│          LangGraph (编排层)           │\n│    StateGraph / Node / Edge / Check  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│          LangChain (核心层)           │\n│  LLM / Prompt / Tool / Memory / Ret  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│       langchain-core (抽象层)         │\n│    Runnable / BaseModel / BaseTool   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>选型决策树：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">是否需要复杂控制流？\n├── 否 → 使用LangChain Chain\n│   ├── 简单RAG → Retrieval Chain\n│   └── 单轮/多轮对话 → Conversation Chain\n│\n└── 是 → 使用LangGraph\n    ├── 需要条件分支 → Conditional Edges\n    ├── 需要循环 → Cycles in Graph\n    ├── 需要人工审批 → Human-in-the-loop\n    ├── 需要并行执行 → Parallel Nodes\n    └── 需要断点恢复 → Checkpointing\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：同一任务用两种方式实现</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># === 方式1: LangChain Chain（适合简单RAG）===</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>runnables <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> RunnablePassthrough\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>output_parsers <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> StrOutputParser\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 简单RAG链</span>\nrag_chain <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"context\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> retriever <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> format_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"question\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RunnablePassthrough<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> prompt\n    <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> llm\n    <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> StrOutputParser<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># === 方式2: LangGraph（适合带审批的RAG）===</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> StateGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> END\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> TypedDict\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">RAGState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>TypedDict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    question<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    confidence<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span>\n    needs_review<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    docs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"question\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"context\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> format_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">generate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    answer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">format</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"answer\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"confidence\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.9</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">check_confidence</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"review\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"confidence\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"end\"</span>\n\nworkflow <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StateGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>RAGState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"retrieve\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> retrieve<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"generate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_entry_point<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"retrieve\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"retrieve\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"generate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_conditional_edges<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"generate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> check_confidence<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"human_review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 人工审批节点</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"end\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> END\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：LangGraph是否可以完全替代LangChain？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：不能。LangGraph依赖LangChain的核心组件（如LLM、Tool、Prompt），它只是编排层。LangChain的链式抽象在简单场景下更轻量高效。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：在实际项目中，LangChain和LangGraph如何配合使用？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：LangChain负责组件定义和基础能力封装，LangGraph负责工作流编排。通常每个LangGraph节点内部使用LangChain的链或工具。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：认为LangGraph是LangChain的替代品。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：LangGraph是LangChain的补充，二者是生态内的不同层次。简单任务用LangChain Chain，复杂工作流用LangGraph。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}